  "description": "Meguiar's Paint, Dash & Glass - This Advanced car Detailer is Perfect to Quickly Clean and Protect Your car Inside and Out, Hydrophobic Reinforced car Cleaning for Paint, Plastic, Glass - Distributed/Packaged by Meguiar'S. Product Details: When to use Meguiar's Paint, Dash & Glass Inside & Out Detailer? The question is more like when should you not use Meguiar's Paint Dash & Glass?! This revolutionary spray detailer provides quick and easy cleaning with hydrophobic protection on indoor and outdoor surfaces. It easily removes dust, grim, fingerprints and bird droppings from paint, trimming and glass. While it cleans and protects, it leaves a non-greasy finish and ensures streak-free cleaning of exterior glass. This versatile detailer is perfect for touch-ups, after washing hands, after running your car through a tunnel car wash, maintaining a clean vehicle or cleaning the stain if necessary. For exterior surfaces, all you need to do is mist on a section, spread out with a premium microfiber towel and twist your towel onto a clean area to wipe it dry. For interior surfaces, spray the product on a microfiber towel and clean the affected area. Turn the towel into a dry area and wipe dry. So whether you work with paint, plastic, upholstery, vinyl, leather, glass or car screens, this advanced car detailer spray quickly and easily cleans and protects your interior and exterior in just one step!",
